                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "What an enjoyable game, definitely worth a play! I love the air of mystery and the thrill of espionage. Even if it is a somewhat short experience, there's a good amount of depth in there (with more than one ending to discover!). The story unfolds in a very interesting way, and I would hate to spoil that. It really makes you think about things like trust, loyalty and uncovering truth. The art is nicely drawn, and the puzzles are fun. The translation into English was very well done, it was easy for me to understand. I am excited to see what comes next from this developer!",
